        "created_at": "2022-02-13T20:14:57.357Z",
        "cooked": "<p>(Sorry for the Necromancy, but I thought that this post didn’t warrant its own thread.)</p>\n<p>Here’s a minifig’ I made of Black Fist, Grandmaster of the Streets!<br>\n<div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/ed4908fec5c7176d7db62dc88d1408b56a94e5a4.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/ed4908fec5c7176d7db62dc88d1408b56a94e5a4\" title=\"Black Fist\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ed4908fec5c7176d7db62dc88d1408b56a94e5a4_2_243x375.jpeg\" alt=\"Black Fist\" data-base62-sha1=\"xR7DwLEXYkBjYaX7cY5HtcYnF2Y\" width=\"243\" height=\"375\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ed4908fec5c7176d7db62dc88d1408b56a94e5a4_2_243x375.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ed4908fec5c7176d7db62dc88d1408b56a94e5a4_2_364x562.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ed4908fec5c7176d7db62dc88d1408b56a94e5a4_2_486x750.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/e/ed4908fec5c7176d7db62dc88d1408b56a94e5a4_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Black Fist</span><span class=\"informations\">1509×2324 368 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p>I’m not one to modify LEGOⓇ pieces, so this isn’t as accurate as the others posted in this thread, unfortunately.</p>",
